            "review_title": "Review at Quan Com Hue Nhu",
            "review_text": "Rafael O\n2 contributions\n0\nHorrible, shrimp in bad condition and they refuse to change them\nMay 2024 • Couples\nHorrible, after 15 days in Vietnam and having eaten well in all the places, this is the worst in every way, you enter and the restaurant smells strange, the super scarce dishes seem like dessert, the tuna salad barely has tuna, the The pork was only fat and the prawns were in bad condition, the skin and on top of the soggy meat couldn't be peeled off, I tell the waitress and she tells me that another day she will be more careful, and that she can't return it to the kitchen, I tell her I'm not going to eat it or pay for it, the dish was 6 prawns and we left 4 and a half, when it came to paying they charged me for it, to my surprise when we haven't eaten it, something amazing, we will never go back The treatment in this place is shameful 😡\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten June 12, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
